{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven mystery puzzle game. The game follows a little girl's strange day: her Mom mysteriously vanishes, and her Dad acts strangely. The girl sets out to investigate on her own, and as she delves deeper, everything becomes increasingly confusing...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Storyline:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1) The demo serves as the starting point for the entire story. What begins as a seemingly peaceful morning soon unfolds into a series of strange occurrences! Follow the girl's footsteps as you unravel interconnected puzzles through careful observation, meticulous deduction, and imaginative thinking.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2) The demo corresponds to Chapter 1, Section 1 of the full game; The full game will feature 3 major chapters with multiple sections, offering more stories and puzzles to discover.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Game Design:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1) The demo offers a variety of puzzle types to experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2) The full game will feature even more diverse puzzles, along with exciting mini-games requiring skillful actions. Stay tuned!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Art Style:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1)\tAll the game sprites are hand-drawn by us.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2)\tThe art style is really unique and diverse, which give clues about the stories that happen to the characters and their emotional changes. This makes the puzzle game look really different and interesting.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069070?t=1759399908","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage