rse puzzles, along with exciting mini-games requiring skillful actions. Stay tuned!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Art Style:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(1)\tAll the game sprites are hand-drawn by us.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(2)\tThe art style is really unique and diverse, which give clues about the stories that happen to the characters and their emotional changes. This makes the puzzle game look really different and interesting.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Foxy KK & Squeaky ZZ"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3985920","name":"Another Day of My Life"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069070/fa78fa434ef5762bfdc032625c7a5ca1066de335/header.jpg?t=1759399908","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.13 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz or above<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The mouse and keyboard are essential for this game.</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069070/1470960957/71527ebac7d73597eb3e354de9178f454f8a7767/1759399571/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759399906","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069070/1470960957/71527ebac7d73597eb3e354de9178f454f8a7767/1759399571/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759399906","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069070/1470960957/71527ebac7d73597eb3e354de9178f454f8a7767/1759399571/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759399906","id":257210644,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer